{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想隨時下一局五子棋，《Gomoku》把安靜現代的棋室放進手機：15×15 自由五子棋，黑棋先行，可與離線的強勁對手對弈，連線時亦可挑戰 DeepSeek 雲端玩家，或與朋友在同一部裝置輪流對戰。對局記錄預設留在裝置，無需社交帳號，適合通勤或空檔時動腦的玩家。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>離線對弈與雲端對戰</h2>\n<p>棋盤為 15×15 自由五子棋，黑棋先行；離線對手由本地 local-v5 驅動，無網絡亦可練習。連線時可選擇 DeepSeek 雲端對戰，每步均經合法步法驗證，亦支援同一裝置二人對戰。對局記錄可逐步重播，內建落子預覽與 12 種介面語言。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-292-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-293-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-294-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-295-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-296-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Gomoku: AI Challenge</li>\n<li>應用類別：Entertainment</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-21T01:29:23.283242+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":339,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}